  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#common-input-element-apis\r\n\r\n> The list IDL attribute must return the current suggestions source element, if any, or null otherwise\\.\r\n\r\nIs it worth mentioning (at least for the developer edition) that, although this is read-only, it can be changed by using setAttribute?\r\n\r\n(I'm creating inputs dynamically in a repeated section of a form.)",
